WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.845
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:10.115 --> 00:11.658
[theme music playing]

3
00:28.633 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

4
00:30.135 --> 00:32.137
[romantic music playing]

5
00:35.807 --> 00:38.518
[distant sirens wailing]

6
00:48.027 --> 00:50.196
[music intensifies]

7
01:03.209 --> 01:04.085
[music softens]

8
01:04.169 --> 01:05.086
Miss Na,

9
01:06.337 --> 01:08.423
I don't wanna just protect you anymore.

10
01:09.716 --> 01:10.550
What?

11
01:11.259 --> 01:12.427
Na Bo-bae…

12
01:16.264 --> 01:17.557
I'm crazy about you.

13
01:17.640 --> 01:19.309
[romantic Korean ballad playing]

14
01:44.626 --> 01:46.669
[romantic Korean ballad continues]

15
01:54.469 --> 01:55.929
[music softens]

16
01:56.012 --> 01:57.764
[Miss Na] Stupid slow motion. Ugh…

17
01:58.640 --> 02:00.767
This is taking way too long.

18
02:02.560 --> 02:03.978
[kissing]

19
02:05.480 --> 02:07.065
[Miss Na kissing]

20
02:07.148 --> 02:08.233
[Miss Na grunting]

21
02:08.316 --> 02:09.359
Come on!

22
02:12.487 --> 02:13.321
Hm?

23
02:13.821 --> 02:16.241
So this is what lips feel like?

24
02:18.326 --> 02:19.702
-[quack] -[gasps]

25
02:19.786 --> 02:20.703
Oh!

26
02:20.787 --> 02:22.205
[dramatic music playing]

27
02:25.583 --> 02:27.168
[grunts sleepily, gasps]

28
02:27.919 --> 02:29.462
[sniffles, sighs]

29
02:29.545 --> 02:33.633
Oh no, I was dreaming about my script again? [sighs]

30
02:33.716 --> 02:38.221
Seriously, even in my dreams, I manage to get writer's block?

31
02:38.304 --> 02:41.015
I couldn't even get to the kiss part?

32
02:41.099 --> 02:42.100
[tuts, sighs]

33
02:42.850 --> 02:43.935
Oh shoot.

34
02:44.018 --> 02:45.144
[lively music playing]

35
02:45.228 --> 02:46.521
THE CITY WITHOUT LIGHTS

36
02:46.604 --> 02:48.022
THE FINAL CHAPTER, AGAIN

37
02:49.357 --> 02:52.360
So if I were the main character in a drama,

38
02:52.443 --> 02:54.904
this is how I'd be introduced.

39
02:56.698 --> 02:58.366
-[man grunts] -[Miss Na groans]

40
03:00.493 --> 03:02.912
-Bo-bae, hurry up and get ready. -[Bo-bae] Okay!

41
03:02.996 --> 03:04.872
[Korean pop music playing]

42
03:06.666 --> 03:08.334
[Bo-bae] Meet Na Bo-bae.

43
03:08.835 --> 03:10.795
A woman who's pushing 30

44
03:10.878 --> 03:13.423
with no clear plan for the future.

45
03:15.800 --> 03:16.801
[groans]

46
03:16.884 --> 03:20.346
Ji-hye, where's my hoodie? You know my checkered one?

47
03:20.430 --> 03:22.640
Oh, I put it outside.

48
03:23.641 --> 03:24.892
[Bo-bae] That's my older sister,

49
03:24.976 --> 03:27.979
a soon-to-be-married national tae kwon do gold medalist.

50
03:28.062 --> 03:30.356
-Hey, Yong-gi! -[Yong-gi] Yeah?

51
03:30.440 --> 03:31.399
Throw it over!

52
03:31.482 --> 03:32.483
-This one? -[Bo-bae] Yeah

53
03:32.567 --> 03:33.609
Here!

54
03:33.693 --> 03:35.361
[Bo-bae] That's my older brother,

55
03:35.445 --> 03:38.239
a national judo medalist who now owns his own dojo.

56
03:38.740 --> 03:40.074
And then, there's me,

57
03:40.158 --> 03:44.871
the youngest and the only writer in a family of athletes.

58
03:44.954 --> 03:45.955
CONTEST AWARD ONE-EP DRAMA

59
03:46.748 --> 03:50.168
Luckily, my family has always loved me and supported me,

60
03:50.251 --> 03:53.463
despite my rather unusual condition.

61
03:53.546 --> 03:54.380
[grunts]

62
03:54.881 --> 03:56.090
Heading out!

63
03:56.174 --> 03:57.633
-[Yong-gi] You're leaving? -Yeah.

64
03:57.717 --> 04:01.429
[Ji-hye] You're almost 30 now. How are you still always late for work?

65
04:01.512 --> 04:02.764
-Wait! -[Ji-hye] Breakfast!

66
04:02.847 --> 04:05.933
-I don't want it. My stomach hurts… -Come on, open up, Bo-bae.

67
04:06.017 --> 04:07.518
-[Yong-gi] Just eat. -My stomach hurts.

68
04:07.602 --> 04:09.479
-[Ji-hye] Nonsense. Eat it slowly. -I'm going.

69
04:10.688 --> 04:13.816
You see, I'd left home to chase writing career,

70
04:13.900 --> 04:18.029
boldly promising my parents I'd crawl back if I didn't make it by 30.

71
04:18.112 --> 04:19.530
Make it happen!

72
04:21.824 --> 04:24.827
[Bo-bae] So these days, I'd say I'm walking a tightrope,

73
04:24.911 --> 04:27.747
always teetering on the verge of failure.

74
04:27.830 --> 04:28.706
[crackling]

75
04:30.124 --> 04:31.376
[pop music fades]

76
04:34.629 --> 04:36.839
[gasps] Ow, jeez.

77
04:36.923 --> 04:38.049
[grunts]

78
04:42.428 --> 04:44.806
[bus brakes squeal]

79
04:47.225 --> 04:48.184
Oh… Uh!

80
04:48.267 --> 04:49.352
Um… [gasps softly]

81
04:49.435 --> 04:50.269
[whimpers]

82
04:50.353 --> 04:52.814
Oh no… [whimpers uncertainly]

83
04:52.897 --> 04:54.524
[uneasy music playing]

84
04:59.779 --> 05:01.072
[stop bell dings]

85
05:10.373 --> 05:13.167
-[suspenseful music playing] -[electricity crackling]

86
05:15.420 --> 05:16.504
[music fades]

87
05:17.380 --> 05:19.674
[Bo-bae breathing nervously]

88
05:25.471 --> 05:26.973
[whimpering unsteadily]

89
05:28.015 --> 05:30.685
-[yelping unsteadily] -[suspenseful music playing]

90
05:33.354 --> 05:34.981
[gentle music playing]

91
05:35.815 --> 05:38.734
[Bo-bae] Wow, he's incredibly good-looking.

92
05:38.818 --> 05:40.111
[gasps softly]

93
05:40.194 --> 05:43.364
A guy like him would be perfect as a leading man.

94
05:44.449 --> 05:46.993
Oh, no, not, like, my leading man or anything.

95
05:47.076 --> 05:50.246
I mean, like a leading man in one of my scripts.

96
05:52.206 --> 05:53.040
[brakes screech]

97
05:53.124 --> 05:54.167
[Bo-bae screams]

98
05:54.250 --> 05:56.043
[sweeping romantic music playing]

99
05:59.213 --> 06:01.299
[heartbeat pounding]

100
06:05.219 --> 06:07.346
You… okay there?

101
06:08.639 --> 06:10.475
[Bo-bae] If this were a drama,

102
06:10.558 --> 06:12.935
this would be the start of our love story.

103
06:13.936 --> 06:14.896
Uh…

104
06:15.646 --> 06:18.107
[Bo-bae] But for me, this isn't a love story.

105
06:19.066 --> 06:20.526
It's a horror show.

106
06:20.610 --> 06:21.611
Oh, I'm so sorry!

107
06:21.694 --> 06:23.112
-Because… -Ow, that hurts!

108
06:23.196 --> 06:25.323
…romance doesn't exist for a girl like me.

109
06:25.990 --> 06:27.992
But it does for the girl in my scripts.

110
06:28.075 --> 06:30.203
[confident music playing]

111
06:31.787 --> 06:34.248
HYE-JU STRIDES AWAY

112
06:34.332 --> 06:35.249
Miss Hye-ju, please.

113
06:35.333 --> 06:36.709
(WITH A BURNING GAZE) MA'AM!

114
06:36.792 --> 06:38.794
[suspenseful music playing]

115
06:42.048 --> 06:43.382
Why did you follow me on the bus?

116
06:43.466 --> 06:45.551
I told you, I didn't need you to escort me to work.

117
06:46.594 --> 06:49.472
How could I not follow you? I can't stop thinking about you.

118
06:49.555 --> 06:51.933
Well, I won't stand for this inappropriate behavior.

119
06:52.016 --> 06:53.851
Start acting like my bodyguard.

120
06:54.894 --> 06:57.730
AS HYE-JU TURNS TO WALK AWAY, I-HYEOK GRABS HER ARM

121
06:57.813 --> 06:59.440
[suspenseful music building]

122
06:59.524 --> 07:03.653
I-HYEOK PULLS HER INTO A ROUGH KISS

123
07:05.738 --> 07:09.492
HYE-JU IS STARTLED AT FIRST, BUT SOON MELTS INTO THE KISS

124
07:18.417 --> 07:22.797
[breathlessly] Your lips are delectable. They taste like honey.

125
07:22.880 --> 07:25.049
[feistily] Your lips taste good as well.

126
07:26.342 --> 07:27.176
[music stops]

127
07:27.260 --> 07:28.594
What kind of mess is that?

128
07:28.678 --> 07:29.804
Oh!

129
07:33.182 --> 07:36.644
-What now? -It's always the kissing scenes with you.

130
07:36.727 --> 07:39.146
Lips taste like honey? What were you thinking?

131
07:39.230 --> 07:41.774
Is this guy a bear? Why would he point that out?

132
07:41.857 --> 07:44.819
And a bodyguard can't just kiss their boss like that. It's unprofessional.

133
07:44.902 --> 07:47.780
-Or maybe dangerous. -Sure, maybe it looks good on paper.

134
07:47.863 --> 07:51.325
But we live in a woke era now. You need to get with the times.

135
07:51.409 --> 07:55.371
I mean, this male lead, he's been her bodyguard for only two weeks.

136
07:55.454 --> 07:58.916
So why would he risk his job to kiss a woman he barely even knows?

137
07:59.000 --> 08:01.752
I mean, isn't that what you do when you fall in love?

138
08:01.836 --> 08:03.170
When you know, you know…

139
08:03.254 --> 08:05.673
I mean, you'd risk anything to make them yours

140
08:05.756 --> 08:07.758
and your brain gets all fuzzy when they're around--

141
08:07.842 --> 08:08.801
Miss Na.

142
08:09.302 --> 08:10.636
Please be honest with me.

143
08:12.054 --> 08:13.431
Have you ever been on a date?

144
08:14.015 --> 08:16.309
What? Come on.

145
08:16.392 --> 08:18.394
-I'm almost 30 now. -[awkward music plays]

146
08:18.477 --> 08:20.730
How could you ask me such a thing? I mean…

147
08:20.813 --> 08:23.357
[man] Oh really? So you've been on dates before?

148
08:23.441 --> 08:25.735
You've been on romantic amusement park dates

149
08:25.818 --> 08:27.403
and Hangang River walks?

150
08:27.486 --> 08:31.699
I'll have you know… I've done it all. That's just the tip of the iceberg.

151
08:31.782 --> 08:35.161
I used to have guys lining up for me back in the day.

152
08:35.244 --> 08:38.623
Oh, really? So what did all that amount to exactly?

153
08:38.706 --> 08:40.249
Look at the poor lead in this.

154
08:40.333 --> 08:42.752
He didn't just kill the romance in this script.

155
08:42.835 --> 08:44.503
He ran it over and backed up again.

156
08:44.587 --> 08:46.047
[Bo-bae] Of course it's bad.

157
08:46.130 --> 08:49.800
I'm so chronically single that I bolt if a guy so much as touches my hand.

158
08:49.884 --> 08:51.886
Seriously, the rest is okay.

159
08:51.969 --> 08:54.263
At the start of your career, everyone wanted a piece of you,

160
08:54.347 --> 08:56.182
but I called first dibs on your work.

161
08:56.265 --> 08:58.893
Your lines are great. The story's great. The leads three-dimensional.

162
08:58.976 --> 09:02.271
But why do they turn into a mess the minute there's romance involved?

163
09:02.355 --> 09:04.273
You're betraying your viewers.

164
09:04.357 --> 09:06.359
It's like you're stabbing them right in the heart.

165
09:06.442 --> 09:09.487
You know that's not my intention.

166
09:09.570 --> 09:11.739
[man] Look, your contract ends in three months.

167
09:11.822 --> 09:15.076
You do want to renew it, don't you?

168
09:15.576 --> 09:16.494
Yeah.

169
09:17.078 --> 09:19.121
-[dreamy music playing] -Three months, okay.

170
09:19.205 --> 09:22.416
I'm giving you three whole months

171
09:22.500 --> 09:24.710
to write a steamy love story

172
09:24.794 --> 09:27.922
Grab a person off the street for inspiration if you have to.

173
09:28.005 --> 09:30.132
A sexy romance.

174
09:30.216 --> 09:31.342
[awkward music plays]

175
09:31.425 --> 09:33.177
You get me that, okay?

176
09:34.261 --> 09:35.096
Yeah.

177
09:35.179 --> 09:37.890
-[strong wind blowing] -[uneasy music playing]

178
09:40.476 --> 09:42.687
TS RESORT, JEJU

179
09:42.770 --> 09:45.898
[people screaming]

180
09:45.981 --> 09:47.483
Oh shit!

181
09:47.566 --> 09:49.485
-[grunting] -[women yelling]

182
09:51.404 --> 09:54.115
Ah, I think the rain got in my mouth!

183
09:54.198 --> 09:55.741
[all yelling]

184
09:56.492 --> 09:58.035
[man] Where are we even going?

185
09:58.119 --> 10:01.997
-That way! -Why won't they just pick up the phone?

186
10:02.081 --> 10:03.040
[squeals]

187
10:05.501 --> 10:07.253
["Clair de Lune" playing]

188
10:29.567 --> 10:31.527
[cell phone buzzing]

189
10:33.612 --> 10:35.614
Yes? Are you almost there?

190
10:43.247 --> 10:44.540
You can head up now.

191
10:47.418 --> 10:48.753
Get the cameras ready.

192
10:49.336 --> 10:51.005
[man sniffs, sighs]

193
10:57.303 --> 10:58.888
[distant sirens wailing]

194
10:58.971 --> 10:59.805
TS RESORT, SEOUL

195
10:59.889 --> 11:02.475
[woman] Who's telling him about what's going on at the Jeju resort?

196
11:02.558 --> 11:05.686
Human Resources should handle it. It was flagged by the general manager.

197
11:05.770 --> 11:09.607
No, anything regarding reservations should be handled by the Rooms department.

198
11:10.483 --> 11:11.609
[uneasily] Oh jeez.

199
11:12.193 --> 11:14.361
Well, I can picture it now.

200
11:14.445 --> 11:17.323
That smug little know-it-all picking everything apart.

201
11:17.907 --> 11:19.200
What's that for?

202
11:19.825 --> 11:20.743
Indigestion.

203
11:21.452 --> 11:23.454
Look! I think he's arriving now.

204
11:24.622 --> 11:27.082
Here. Okay.

205
11:27.166 --> 11:29.043
[suave music playing]

206
11:35.841 --> 11:37.760
[brakes squealing]

207
11:50.105 --> 11:51.190
Hello, sir.

208
11:54.944 --> 11:55.945
Let's go.

209
12:12.378 --> 12:14.630
Um, excuse me, sir.

210
12:15.297 --> 12:17.550
About the typhoon that hit Jeju…

211
12:17.633 --> 12:19.510
It was pretty devastating.

212
12:20.010 --> 12:21.053
I'm aware.

213
12:21.136 --> 12:24.682
Sir, the damage assessment from the typhoon

214
12:24.765 --> 12:26.767
has become quite substantial.

215
12:27.268 --> 12:29.937
We appreciate that you built the buildings so sturdily

216
12:30.020 --> 12:32.314
that the main facilities weren't affected.

217
12:32.815 --> 12:36.235
But with the grounded flights and road blocks,

218
12:36.318 --> 12:38.946
we've had many cancellations.

219
12:39.822 --> 12:43.993
Our team is monitoring the financial impact.

220
12:48.205 --> 12:49.039
Mm.

221
12:50.833 --> 12:51.876
[clears throat]

222
12:55.170 --> 12:58.382
These will be the specials on the menu this season.

223
12:58.924 --> 13:00.092
Everything else can go.

224
13:00.175 --> 13:02.052
[suave music resumes]

225
13:06.891 --> 13:09.977
Sir, we're still working on the exact number of cancellations.

226
13:10.060 --> 13:11.687
We'll report back by end of day.

227
13:11.770 --> 13:12.980
Okay. What else?

228
13:13.480 --> 13:15.441
Uh, according to our analysis,

229
13:15.524 --> 13:19.069
it seems that we may not be able to meet TS Resort's sales goal

230
13:19.153 --> 13:20.529
by the 30th anniversary.

231
13:21.947 --> 13:23.073
That light is out.

232
13:24.199 --> 13:25.451
[Rooms manager snaps]

233
13:26.201 --> 13:28.787
Oh, yeah. We'll have that changed immediately.

234
13:29.330 --> 13:31.332
[chuckles] We did manage

235
13:31.415 --> 13:34.501
to get all the cancellation fees processed for the Jeju resort.

236
13:34.585 --> 13:37.755
And the guests currently on-site have all requested to prolong their stays,

237
13:37.838 --> 13:40.299
so we'll collect additional room fees from all of them.

238
13:40.382 --> 13:43.177
[chuckles] So no need to worry about that, sir.

239
13:43.260 --> 13:44.136
Really?

240
13:44.219 --> 13:47.681
Yes, and those problematic guests who wouldn't pay the additional fees

241
13:47.765 --> 13:49.266
were forcibly evicted.

242
13:50.392 --> 13:51.518
[music fades]

243
13:52.811 --> 13:57.316
Hm. And who was the one who made that decision?

244
13:57.399 --> 13:59.485
Uh, it was General Manager Heo Ji-Hwan.

245
14:01.695 --> 14:02.529
Ah-ha.

246
14:03.113 --> 14:04.490
The general manager.

247
14:05.741 --> 14:07.576
[suave music playing]

248
14:16.168 --> 14:18.003
-Mr. Yoon. -Yes, sir.

249
14:18.087 --> 14:20.130
You said we recently changed landscapers, right?

250
14:20.214 --> 14:21.215
Yes, sir.

251
14:21.298 --> 14:22.341
Change them again.

252
14:22.841 --> 14:24.134
The layout is wrong.

253
14:24.718 --> 14:25.970
Yes, agreed, sir.

254
14:26.845 --> 14:30.474
[inhales deeply, sighs] Mr. Jang?

255
14:30.557 --> 14:32.142
Uh, yes, sir?

256
14:32.226 --> 14:34.561
Would you mind calling our general manager, please?

257
14:34.645 --> 14:35.771
Yes, sir.

258
14:39.066 --> 14:40.818
TS RESORT JEJU GENERAL MANAGER HEO JI-HWAN

259
14:40.901 --> 14:42.903
-[outgoing call tone] -Hello, Mr. Heo?

260
14:42.987 --> 14:45.823
[Heo] Yes, hello. How's everything going on your end?

261
14:45.906 --> 14:49.868
Good. The Jeju resort has been in a state of emergency,

262
14:49.952 --> 14:52.496
but you've handled the situation so well.

263
14:52.579 --> 14:56.000
I'm calling because Director Baek personally wanted to speak to you.

264
14:56.083 --> 14:57.459
[Heo] Oh, it was nothing.

265
14:57.543 --> 15:00.129
As the general manager of the TS Resort in Jeju,

266
15:00.212 --> 15:01.797
I had to take immediate action.

267
15:02.381 --> 15:04.133
I have everything under control.

268
15:04.216 --> 15:05.676
Yes. [chuckles]

269
15:06.468 --> 15:07.553
Miss Go,

270
15:07.636 --> 15:09.013
have you arrived yet?

271
15:09.555 --> 15:11.849
Yes, we just got in, sir. Cameras are ready.

272
15:11.932 --> 15:14.059
-[intriguing music playing] -[cameras clicking]

273
15:15.102 --> 15:16.061
What are you doing?

274
15:16.145 --> 15:19.565
Excuse me. Look right here, please. You're being recorded.

275
15:19.648 --> 15:22.443
-What's going on? Get away! -Who gave you permission to film me? Huh?

276
15:22.526 --> 15:24.028
-Why are you doing this? -Mr. Baek.

277
15:24.111 --> 15:27.656
As you concluded, the general manager, Mr. Heo is holding some sort of meeting

278
15:27.740 --> 15:30.367
with members of the golf club in one of the cancelled suites.

279
15:30.451 --> 15:31.660
-Wait. -[woman] Okay.

280
15:31.744 --> 15:35.956
-Mr. Baek confirmed he has the video. -And we've also secured the images.

281
15:36.040 --> 15:37.583
-What? -[man] What the hell is this?

282
15:37.666 --> 15:40.169
[Heo] Where did you guys even come from?

283
15:43.756 --> 15:44.965
Was that clear enough?

284
15:46.508 --> 15:50.888
Mr. Heo has been helping himself to the canceled suites.

285
15:50.971 --> 15:53.015
Unauthorized, of course

286
15:53.098 --> 15:54.349
and on the company dime.

287
15:54.433 --> 15:56.769
-Is he insane? -Is this really news to you?

288
15:56.852 --> 15:58.020
[Jang] Of course not!

289
15:58.103 --> 16:01.523
Remove Mr. Heo from the premises and proceed with pressing charges.

290
16:02.274 --> 16:06.028
Have the administrative team apologize to the guests who were forcibly evicted.

291
16:06.737 --> 16:08.072
I'll take care of it right away

292
16:08.155 --> 16:10.115
[Baek] I want you to open up all available rooms

293
16:10.199 --> 16:13.619
to the victims of the typhoon at the Jeju resort,

294
16:13.702 --> 16:16.663
and don't take any payments.

295
16:16.747 --> 16:17.956
[both] What?

296
16:18.540 --> 16:21.001
Oh, well, that's very nice of you.

297
16:21.877 --> 16:22.795
[Baek] Oh.

298
16:25.839 --> 16:29.259
You said we probably wouldn't be able to make our sales goal

299
16:29.343 --> 16:30.803
for our 30th anniversary.

300
16:32.638 --> 16:33.680
Well,

301
16:34.264 --> 16:35.849
I think I can fix that.

302
16:36.642 --> 16:38.644
[uplifting music playing]

303
16:48.320 --> 16:50.697
WISHING A SWIFT RECOVERY AND RESTORATION TO THE TS RESORT TEAM

304
16:50.781 --> 16:52.241
Right here, this way please.

305
17:01.625 --> 17:03.502
We're not taking any reservations at the moment,

306
17:03.585 --> 17:05.796
the rooms are booked for the victims of the typhoon.

307
17:05.879 --> 17:07.923
[man] The power's out. You'll need to take the stairs.

308
17:08.006 --> 17:12.052
Yeah, the lobby is completely full. Take your group to a different area. Okay?

309
17:12.136 --> 17:15.764
[reporter] TS Resort Jeju has decided to open up the entire resort

310
17:15.848 --> 17:17.724
to house the victims of the typhoon.

311
17:18.350 --> 17:21.854
Senior Managing Director, Baek Ho-rang is heading the project,

312
17:21.937 --> 17:25.816
which involves converting the rooms and lobby into emergency shelters.

313
17:25.899 --> 17:29.862
He also plans to be heavily involved in the recovery efforts.

314
17:31.697 --> 17:33.073
Updates on Jeju?

315
17:33.574 --> 17:36.285
People with disabilities, pregnant women, and children

316
17:36.368 --> 17:37.703
have been assigned suites.

317
17:37.786 --> 17:39.830
Private accommodations have also been allocated

318
17:39.913 --> 17:41.373
to individual guests and families.

319
17:41.456 --> 17:42.499
And financial aid?

320
17:42.583 --> 17:45.752
Yes, as you requested, all victims will have their stays comped for a month.

321
17:45.836 --> 17:48.463
We've also decided to donate funds to the Jeju City Hall

322
17:48.547 --> 17:50.090
and provide free relief supplies.

323
17:50.174 --> 17:54.303
The media is praising your call to action and the public response is positive.

324
17:54.386 --> 17:56.930
Our stock price has also gone up considerably.

325
17:58.557 --> 18:01.852
I'm thinking we need to announce our new brand ambassador.

326
18:01.935 --> 18:03.312
Have you found anyone?

327
18:04.438 --> 18:05.355
Well…

328
18:06.315 --> 18:08.483
[suave music playing]

329
18:08.567 --> 18:10.402
…our first choice is the actor Ji Eun-ho.

330
18:10.485 --> 18:12.696
He has the best reputation in the industry.

331
18:12.779 --> 18:15.240
He's a rising star with idol-level fame

332
18:15.324 --> 18:18.535
and is receiving endless offers to star in dramas and films.

333
18:23.332 --> 18:24.750
WHEN THE SCHOOL BELL RINGS

334
18:25.250 --> 18:26.293
TOP 10 SHOWS IN SOUTH KOREA

335
18:30.047 --> 18:31.340
FOLLOWERS

336
18:31.882 --> 18:33.800
JI EUN-HO "WORLDWIDE FAME FEELS UNREAL"

337
18:33.884 --> 18:36.053
JI EUN-HO EMERGES AS A GLOBAL STAR

338
18:38.180 --> 18:41.350
[Yoon] He recently won Best Actor at the Heuksang Arts Awards.

339
18:41.850 --> 18:43.936
The drama he starred in was a massive hit.

340
18:44.019 --> 18:47.272
He has an international fan base. He's even been cast in a Hollywood film.

341
18:49.191 --> 18:50.859
So what's the problem?

342
18:52.319 --> 18:55.614
Well, um… it's precisely for those reasons…

343
18:55.697 --> 18:57.991
[sighs, inhales deeply]

344
18:58.075 --> 19:00.035
…that we can't seem to get in touch with him.

345
19:00.118 --> 19:01.411
[Baek sighs]

346
19:02.079 --> 19:03.080
Mr. Yoon,

347
19:04.206 --> 19:05.457
are you serious?

348
19:07.167 --> 19:09.127
I can't do this anymore.

349
19:09.211 --> 19:12.839
I'm already stressed out of my mind trying to manage the Jeju disaster,

350
19:12.923 --> 19:14.841
now you're coming to me with this?

351
19:16.718 --> 19:20.097
How are you supposed to sign him when you can't even get in touch with him?

352
19:20.180 --> 19:22.224
What kind of update is that?

353
19:22.307 --> 19:24.476
Why am I the only one who takes this seriously?

354
19:24.559 --> 19:25.894
-[beeping] -[Yoon] Mr. Baek.

355
19:27.187 --> 19:28.188
Mr. Baek.

356
19:29.648 --> 19:31.233
Don't startle me like that.

357
19:31.733 --> 19:33.443
You know my heart is weak.

358
19:33.527 --> 19:34.945
You need to calm down.

359
19:35.028 --> 19:36.405
Take a deep breath.

360
19:37.197 --> 19:38.073
[Baek sighs]

361
19:38.573 --> 19:41.493
Your pulse is above 100 beats per minute right now.

362
19:43.412 --> 19:45.664
It's been doing that all the time lately.

363
19:45.747 --> 19:46.999
Deep breath.

364
19:47.082 --> 19:48.625
[exhales deeply]

365
19:48.709 --> 19:51.211
-[Baek exhales deeply] -[calming music playing]

366
19:52.504 --> 19:53.964
Empty your mind.

367
19:54.047 --> 19:56.675
Let go of all your thoughts and worries.

368
19:56.758 --> 19:58.427
[Baek exhales deeply]

369
20:00.387 --> 20:04.141
And the impossible belief that you can control everything,

370
20:04.224 --> 20:05.559
that obsession,

371
20:06.643 --> 20:08.103
just let it go.

372
20:10.022 --> 20:12.524
-[exhales deeply] -[Baek exhales deeply]

373
20:13.692 --> 20:14.776
[sniffs]

374
20:15.986 --> 20:17.988
[exhales deeply]

375
20:20.574 --> 20:21.950
[music fades]

376
20:22.034 --> 20:24.870
-Where is Ji Eun-ho right now? -What?

377
20:24.953 --> 20:26.246
I'll find him

378
20:26.330 --> 20:27.831
and sign him myself.

379
20:31.877 --> 20:33.170
[sighs]

380
20:37.716 --> 20:38.550
[woman sighs]

381
20:39.634 --> 20:40.719
-[Bo-bae sighs] -Na.

382
20:40.802 --> 20:42.512
-Oh, Seo-jeong. -Bo-bae.

383
20:42.596 --> 20:44.306
-[elevator chimes] -[doors open]

384
20:44.389 --> 20:45.849
[Seo-jeong sighs]

385
20:49.353 --> 20:50.562
[inhales deeply, sighs]

386
20:51.563 --> 20:55.400
[sighs] I can tell from that look that he chewed you out again.

387
20:55.484 --> 20:57.903
What was it this time, the kiss or the romance?

388
20:57.986 --> 20:59.529
-The kiss scene. -Oh boy.

389
21:00.322 --> 21:02.908
How could Yeom expect anything else from a virgin?

390
21:02.991 --> 21:05.660
-Someone could hear you. -[chuckles softly]

391
21:05.744 --> 21:07.579
-Mm. -[Bo-bae sighs]

392
21:07.662 --> 21:10.540
-[elevator clunks, powers down] -[Seo-jeong gasps]

393
21:10.624 --> 21:13.502
Ugh, not again.

394
21:18.173 --> 21:20.717
What? This one isn't working either.

395
21:21.426 --> 21:23.929
Hey, why isn't anything working? Huh?

396
21:24.012 --> 21:25.472
-I know. -[Seo-jeong groans]

397
21:25.555 --> 21:28.100
Everything's broken. So annoying.

398
21:29.476 --> 21:31.103
-What? -Bo-bae.

399
21:31.186 --> 21:33.855
No, no, no, don't make me do it in public, please.

400
21:33.939 --> 21:36.358
It's just me here. Who cares?

401
21:36.441 --> 21:37.943
What about that?

402
21:38.026 --> 21:39.194
No.

403
21:39.277 --> 21:43.740
Oh, come on. Yeom will lose his mind if I'm late to run his errands.

404
21:43.824 --> 21:44.991
Help a girl out, please.

405
21:45.909 --> 21:47.202
[sighs]

406
21:48.870 --> 21:52.833
Do this for me, and I'll tell you about this date I went on recently,

407
21:52.916 --> 21:56.420
and I'll give you all the details.

408
21:59.172 --> 22:01.133
[groans]

409
22:01.216 --> 22:02.217
[Seo-jeong chuckles]

410
22:03.927 --> 22:06.138
[suspenseful music playing]

411
22:06.221 --> 22:08.014
[Bo-bae inhales deeply]

412
22:09.391 --> 22:10.642
[exhales slowly]

413
22:15.021 --> 22:16.857
[electricity crackling]

414
22:26.741 --> 22:28.493
-[elevator clunks] -Ooh, whoa!

415
22:29.161 --> 22:32.122
Damn. My little human Pikachu.

416
22:32.205 --> 22:34.416
-Don't you call me that. I'm warning you. -[gasps]

417
22:34.499 --> 22:37.878
Okay, okay. I'm sorry, I'm sorry. Really, though, thanks Bo-bae.

418
22:38.712 --> 22:39.796
Sorry.

419
22:41.673 --> 22:42.674
[sighs]

420
22:42.757 --> 22:47.053
The truth is, I've carried this secret with me for my entire life.

421
22:47.137 --> 22:48.763
[intriguing music playing]

422
22:53.935 --> 22:56.480
-[girl] What should we eat? -[boy] Hmm. I want a sundae.

423
22:56.563 --> 22:58.940
-I want tteokbokki. -Then I want two bowls.

424
22:59.733 --> 23:00.942
Then I want three.

425
23:01.026 --> 23:02.235
Four for me, then.

426
23:02.319 --> 23:04.196
[thunder rumbling]

427
23:10.452 --> 23:12.370
[uneasy suspenseful music playing]

428
23:16.583 --> 23:18.126
[thunder clapping]

429
23:19.211 --> 23:20.587
[lightning crackling]

430
23:20.670 --> 23:22.506
[dramatic music playing]

431
23:35.519 --> 23:37.103
[Bo-bae] After I was struck by lightning,

432
23:37.187 --> 23:39.689
I suddenly had the ability to control electricity.

433
23:39.773 --> 23:42.192
-[crying] -[electricity crackling]

434
23:54.412 --> 23:56.289
[breathing shakily] Bo-bae.

435
23:56.373 --> 23:57.332
[gasps]

436
23:57.832 --> 23:59.960
You must never… [shivers]

437
24:00.043 --> 24:03.213
…touch anyone or make any physical contact.

438
24:03.296 --> 24:04.589
[gasps]

439
24:04.673 --> 24:07.676
[Bo-bae] Electricity started to flow through my body.

440
24:07.759 --> 24:09.594
[intriguing music playing]

441
24:22.899 --> 24:24.943
[screams] Ji-hye!

442
24:25.026 --> 24:26.903
-A cockroach! -What? What's wrong?

443
24:26.987 --> 24:30.323
There's a cockroach! Hurry up and catch it!

444
24:30.407 --> 24:32.492
[screams] Ji-hye!

445
24:32.576 --> 24:35.787
[Bo-bae] The more emotional I got, the stronger the electricity got too.

446
24:41.293 --> 24:42.794
B… Bo-bae.

447
24:42.877 --> 24:46.006
You said that you wanted to be with me.

448
24:46.089 --> 24:48.383
You guys haven't even made it official.

449
24:48.466 --> 24:51.886
I mean, come on, he told me you won't even let him hold your hand.

450
24:51.970 --> 24:53.013
[Bo-bae gasps]

451
24:53.638 --> 24:55.265
How could you tell her?

452
24:55.348 --> 24:57.142
What do you expect me to do?

453
24:57.225 --> 25:00.228
You wouldn't let me tell you how I feel, let alone touch you.

454
25:00.312 --> 25:02.522
What guy would put up with something like that, huh?

455
25:03.064 --> 25:04.858
[sad, wistful music playing]

456
25:23.376 --> 25:27.839
[glass shattering]

457
25:27.922 --> 25:29.633
[electricity crackling]

458
25:41.269 --> 25:43.813
[Bo-bae] So I ended up completely alone,

459
25:44.898 --> 25:47.359
thanks to this stupid power of mine.

460
25:56.242 --> 25:57.494
[elevator chimes]

461
25:57.577 --> 25:59.037
You could try to smile.

462
26:00.080 --> 26:02.082
Whoa, whoa. What's with the crowd?

463
26:02.666 --> 26:05.335
Hey, I think a celebrity is here or something. Put your gloves on.

464
26:05.418 --> 26:06.586
See ya.

465
26:07.253 --> 26:10.006
I'll call you after work to kiss and tell.

466
26:12.467 --> 26:15.595
Thanks, you pain in the butt. [groans]

467
26:22.060 --> 26:23.520
[gasps] Ah.

468
26:23.603 --> 26:25.355
[winces, stomach gurgles]

469
26:25.438 --> 26:27.440
Ow. What's wrong with me?

470
26:28.191 --> 26:30.485
[groaning softly]

471
26:35.448 --> 26:36.991
[indistinct murmuring]

472
26:55.510 --> 26:57.303
I didn't consider this.

473
26:58.221 --> 26:59.556
What if the press sees me?

474
27:00.056 --> 27:01.433
[Yoon] I don't think any of them

475
27:02.267 --> 27:03.435
are reporters.

476
27:04.561 --> 27:05.395
[Baek] Hmm.

477
27:05.478 --> 27:06.438
ONY AND ONLY EUN-HO

478
27:07.522 --> 27:08.356
JI EUN-HO

479
27:12.026 --> 27:13.820
Hm. Let's go.

480
27:13.903 --> 27:15.238
[clears throat]

481
27:15.947 --> 27:17.532
[intriguing music playing]

482
27:27.417 --> 27:30.336
[girl 1 gasps] Oh. Oh, my God it's Eun-ho!

483
27:30.420 --> 27:33.798
-Whoa, let's go over there, hurry up! -[girls squealing]

484
27:33.882 --> 27:36.968
[Yoon] Mr. Baek. Mr. Baek. Sir, be careful. Mr. Baek.

485
27:39.304 --> 27:40.555
[camera shutter clicking]

486
27:41.431 --> 27:44.392
Mr. Baek. Mr. Baek. Ah, sir, be careful.

487
27:44.476 --> 27:46.019
Argh.

488
27:46.603 --> 27:47.645
Mr. Baek!

489
27:53.610 --> 27:55.320
[girls screaming]

490
27:56.446 --> 27:59.532
Ah! Thanks so much. Thanks so much. Means a lot.

491
28:00.116 --> 28:01.826
Mr. Baek! No!

492
28:02.702 --> 28:04.829
Thanks so much! Thanks, everyone.

493
28:05.538 --> 28:07.457
[girls screaming in distance]

494
28:15.882 --> 28:17.467
[suspenseful music playing]

495
28:26.810 --> 28:28.645
[music fades slowly]

496
28:29.771 --> 28:30.647
[kissing]

497
28:30.730 --> 28:32.816
[soaring romantic music playing]

498
28:44.202 --> 28:45.620
[music fades]

499
28:46.621 --> 28:47.997
[girls screaming]

500
28:50.583 --> 28:51.501
That…

501
28:52.085 --> 28:52.919
Uh…

502
28:53.962 --> 28:55.964
[hesitates] Are you okay?

503
28:56.047 --> 28:57.674
Oh, uh, uh, yeah.

504
29:00.593 --> 29:02.095
I'm sorry the crowd pushed me.

505
29:02.178 --> 29:04.097
Mm. Uh, I know. It's okay.

506
29:04.681 --> 29:07.433
-All right, then. Uh, so sorry about that. -Oh, sure, yeah.

507
29:14.232 --> 29:15.191
[gasps]

508
29:15.692 --> 29:18.319
-Huh? [gasps] -[intriguing music playing]

509
29:18.403 --> 29:19.404
[Yoon] Sir!

510
29:19.904 --> 29:21.948
Mr. Baek! Excuse me, sorry.

511
29:24.784 --> 29:26.160
-[sighs] -[rapid footsteps approach]

512
29:26.244 --> 29:28.913
-Wait! Hold on, wait. Please! -[gasps]

513
29:28.997 --> 29:32.166
[panting]

514
29:32.250 --> 29:33.668
Wait… [chuckles]

515
29:33.751 --> 29:34.961
Hi there.

516
29:35.044 --> 29:37.088
[breathes heavily]

517
29:38.506 --> 29:39.632
[gasps] Oh.

518
29:40.884 --> 29:42.427
[squeaky toy squeak]

519
29:42.510 --> 29:43.511
Uh. Hey!

520
29:43.595 --> 29:44.888
[gasps]

521
29:44.971 --> 29:46.848
Nothing's happening.

522
29:46.931 --> 29:48.349
What should happen?

523
29:49.100 --> 29:50.476
Um… [clears throat]

524
29:50.560 --> 29:54.689
Uh, earlier when our lips touched, did you feel anything?

525
29:54.772 --> 29:58.109
Like maybe a prickling sensation or a spark?

526
29:58.192 --> 29:59.068
[Baek scoffs]

527
30:00.904 --> 30:03.031
No, no spark for me.

528
30:03.656 --> 30:04.741
If you'll excuse me.

529
30:06.993 --> 30:09.329
Hi. Sorry, but… [chuckles]

530
30:10.204 --> 30:11.581
-What are you-- -Can I just…

531
30:11.664 --> 30:13.291
-What are you doing? -Oh.

532
30:13.374 --> 30:15.293
-Wait, hold on! -Why are you doing that?

533
30:15.376 --> 30:16.836
Just. Please let me…

534
30:16.920 --> 30:20.214
-Stop what you're doing. -Just once. Come on. [grunting]

535
30:22.300 --> 30:23.885
I just need to see…

536
30:24.677 --> 30:26.137
[grunting]

537
30:26.220 --> 30:27.513
Mr. Yoon!

538
30:28.222 --> 30:30.850
-Mr. Yoon! -Oh, Mr. Baek! Mr. Baek!

539
30:30.934 --> 30:33.478
[girls screaming]

540
30:36.898 --> 30:38.024
[gasps]

541
30:39.275 --> 30:41.444
[chuckles] Still nothing.

542
30:41.527 --> 30:42.695
It can't be.

543
30:42.779 --> 30:45.281
Is this guy immune to my electrical powers?

544
30:45.365 --> 30:48.451
Like a human rubber glove?

545
30:51.496 --> 30:52.538
Sorry.

546
30:52.622 --> 30:54.290
-[exhales deeply] -What?

547
30:55.333 --> 30:56.292
Do you think

548
30:56.793 --> 30:59.379
that we could give it one more go?

549
30:59.462 --> 31:01.089
-[Yoon] Mr. Baek! -[Bo-bae gasps]

550
31:03.508 --> 31:05.802
[pants] Please tell me you haven't been hurt.

551
31:05.885 --> 31:06.844
[Baek shudders]

552
31:08.429 --> 31:09.430
[chuckles]

553
31:10.139 --> 31:13.267
-Do you know this woman? -I, uh… don't know her.

554
31:13.977 --> 31:16.145
I'm not interested, so please leave me alone.

555
31:16.729 --> 31:18.731
No… [hesitates] That's not what… Ah.

556
31:19.649 --> 31:22.110
-Oh. Can we talk for a second. -[elevator chimes]

557
31:22.193 --> 31:24.404
Just please, can I? [grunts]

558
31:24.487 --> 31:27.365
I just need to talk to you. It'll only take a second. Please.

559
31:27.448 --> 31:29.784
[shushes] You better not lay a finger on him.

560
31:29.867 --> 31:31.703
-Wait, no… [pants] -[electricity crackles]

561
31:31.786 --> 31:33.538
-[pained grunt] -Oh no. Are you okay?

562
31:33.621 --> 31:35.289
-[gasps] -[jaunty music playing]

563
31:35.373 --> 31:37.291
Then why was there no spark with him?

564
31:39.085 --> 31:40.586
-[gasps] -[gasps]

565
31:41.838 --> 31:43.506
Ah. Argh.

566
31:43.589 --> 31:45.800
-What? -Ah! [pained yelling]

567
31:46.551 --> 31:47.468
-Ah! -What's wrong?

568
31:47.552 --> 31:49.637
-My stomach… Oh, sorry! -[electricity crackles]

569
31:49.721 --> 31:53.266
[pained yelling] Oh, my stomach hurts!

570
31:53.349 --> 31:55.143
[pained crying]

571
31:56.227 --> 31:57.729
Sorry. I…

572
31:57.812 --> 32:03.443
Could you please help me find that man, my human rubber glove?

573
32:03.526 --> 32:05.945
-[paramedic] Does that hurt? -[pained yelling]

574
32:06.029 --> 32:07.905
Let's get you to the hospital right away.

575
32:08.990 --> 32:10.450
[sobbing] No!

576
32:11.242 --> 32:12.577
[siren wailing]

577
32:12.660 --> 32:14.662
119 EMERGENCY MEDICAL SERVICES

578
32:15.621 --> 32:18.666
Look. Whoa. Wonder what happened.

579
32:19.876 --> 32:21.502
The woman in the ambulance

580
32:22.712 --> 32:24.130
looked like Bo-bae, don't you think?

581
32:24.213 --> 32:25.590
Na Bo-bae?

582
32:26.174 --> 32:27.633
Why would she be here?

583
32:28.593 --> 32:32.055
Well, she could've been here for work, you know?

584
32:32.764 --> 32:36.142
-[inhales] I'm gonna call her. -Eun-ho, don't bother with that.

585
32:36.225 --> 32:38.644
You know how important today's meeting is right?

586
32:38.728 --> 32:41.064
-Yeah. -If you disappear on me, I'm dead.

587
32:41.856 --> 32:43.733
Just call her after the meeting, okay?

588
32:44.192 --> 32:46.569
-Damn, I keep dropping all this. -She's not picking up.

589
32:46.652 --> 32:47.904
-Something's wrong. -Hey!

590
32:47.987 --> 32:49.530
Hey, hey, Ji Eun-ho!

591
32:50.031 --> 32:51.157
Here we go.

592
32:51.240 --> 32:54.118
Ji Eun-ho, where are you going? The director is waiting for you!

593
32:54.202 --> 32:55.912
[gentle music playing]

594
32:59.165 --> 33:00.458
[music fades]

595
33:04.545 --> 33:05.546
[sighs]

596
33:07.840 --> 33:11.385
Maybe something came up. He's not usually late.

597
33:11.469 --> 33:14.055
You told me you'd be able to get me a meeting with Ji Eun-ho

598
33:14.138 --> 33:17.558
whenever I wanted, yet Ji Eun-ho is nowhere to be found.

599
33:18.059 --> 33:21.020
Well, I guess I'll mark this down as a coffee date between friends.

600
33:21.104 --> 33:22.939
[chuckles awkwardly] Oh, yes.

601
33:23.022 --> 33:24.107
[Baek sighs]

602
33:24.190 --> 33:27.068
It's been so nice to have some one-on-one time, my friend.

603
33:27.151 --> 33:28.319
-Mr. Yoon. -[Yeom] Ho-rang…

604
33:28.402 --> 33:31.405
I mean, Mr. Baek. Mr. Baek! Just wait. Please, hold on.

605
33:31.906 --> 33:34.367
I'll do whatever it takes. I'm going to get another meeting.

606
33:34.450 --> 33:37.620
All I need is for you to put in a good word for me at TS Resort.

607
33:37.703 --> 33:40.498
They're telling me they're no longer letting us film on location.

608
33:42.041 --> 33:44.377
Did your proposal include any alternatives?

609
33:44.460 --> 33:45.545
Alternatives?

610
33:45.628 --> 33:48.965
If your schedule was planned efficiently, you would've had a backup plan,

611
33:49.048 --> 33:50.383
and they would've said yes.

612
33:50.466 --> 33:52.510
Ho-rang, we're old college friends.

613
33:52.593 --> 33:54.262
Come on, I'm on my knees here.

614
33:54.345 --> 33:57.682
If I was going to do all that paperwork, there'd be no point in asking.

615
33:57.765 --> 34:00.434
Getting me that meeting with him was the only condition

616
34:00.518 --> 34:02.687
for me helping you with location approval.

617
34:02.770 --> 34:05.231
But Ji Eun-ho isn't here, as you can see.

618
34:07.650 --> 34:09.026
-Hey, Ho-rang. -[door opens]

619
34:10.278 --> 34:11.404
-[door closes] -[sighs]

620
34:11.487 --> 34:14.157
Heartless bastard. What kind of backup plan?

621
34:14.240 --> 34:17.869
I'll have Plan A, B, C, D. The whole damn alphabet while I'm at it.

622
34:17.952 --> 34:19.912
You and your stupid backup plan.

623
34:19.996 --> 34:21.956
[dance music playing]

624
34:33.134 --> 34:35.136
[clubbers cheering]

625
34:51.444 --> 34:54.113
Shit. Take a look at this, you fucking bastards!

626
34:54.197 --> 34:58.576
[Ho-rang] "TS Hotel's Choi Do-Yoon Caught Drunk Swearing at Club."

627
34:58.659 --> 35:00.328
"'You effing bastards.'"

628
35:00.995 --> 35:01.829
Look at that.

629
35:02.872 --> 35:06.250
"TS Hotel is facing public backlash following this incident."

630
35:06.334 --> 35:08.419
"TS Hotel has been eliminated

631
35:08.502 --> 35:11.130
from this year's list of finest-ranking hotels

632
35:11.214 --> 35:13.257
and its subsidiary, TS Resort,

633
35:13.341 --> 35:16.844
has also seen a dramatic decline in domestic sales rankings."

634
35:17.511 --> 35:19.138
[sighs, scoffs]

635
35:19.222 --> 35:20.640
[tense music playing]

636
35:21.265 --> 35:24.518
I work to elevate the company's image, and he drags it back down.

637
35:24.602 --> 35:28.022
I feel like we're playing a game of tug-of-war. [sighs]

638
35:29.982 --> 35:31.275
[sighs deeply]

639
35:41.911 --> 35:43.913
[music fades]

640
35:46.290 --> 35:49.794
Find out where Ji Eun-ho is. I need to meet him in person.

641
35:49.877 --> 35:51.087
Meet him today?

642
35:51.170 --> 35:54.298
Sir, you really need to get to the hospital after the temple.

643
35:54.382 --> 35:58.177
Plan A was for you to sign Ji Eun-ho, but you failed on that front.

644
35:58.261 --> 36:01.639
Plan B was for me to convince him today, but that plan fell through as well.

645
36:01.722 --> 36:03.057
Tell me, what do we do now?

646
36:03.140 --> 36:04.350
We go to Plan C, sir.

647
36:04.433 --> 36:07.103
Plan C is for you to find him so I can meet him myself.

648
36:07.186 --> 36:10.189
This needs to happen today, because I pushed my surgery again.

649
36:10.273 --> 36:11.107
But you still--

650
36:11.190 --> 36:15.611
And if we don't meet him today, Plan D is to postpone the surgery indefinitely.

651
36:15.695 --> 36:17.697
Yes, understood, Mr. Baek.

652
36:18.698 --> 36:19.824
I'll find him today.

653
36:19.907 --> 36:21.993
And contact a good ad agency as well.

654
36:22.576 --> 36:24.120
But before any of that,

655
36:24.787 --> 36:26.330
pay your respects to your sister.

656
36:27.206 --> 36:28.874
[pensive music playing]

657
36:54.358 --> 36:55.818
[Ho-rang sighs]

658
36:56.319 --> 36:57.445
You're here.

659
36:58.029 --> 36:59.739
Did you come to see your parents?

660
37:00.531 --> 37:05.661
Yes, I thought they'd be happy to hear that tomorrow will be my last surgery.

661
37:08.956 --> 37:11.292
THE LATE BAEK GYEONG-SEOK THE LATE RYU MIN-SEON

662
37:12.001 --> 37:14.003
Did you see what Do-yoon did?

663
37:14.503 --> 37:16.714
That brat is a lost cause.

664
37:18.341 --> 37:21.344
Are you positive this surgery is going to make you normal?

665
37:21.427 --> 37:22.803
Well, I am already normal.

666
37:22.887 --> 37:25.306
Just make sure you come back completely healthy this time.

667
37:25.389 --> 37:26.891
If you give them any sign of weakness,

668
37:26.974 --> 37:29.352
it'll make the succession process difficult.

669
37:29.435 --> 37:32.271
It's important to present yourself as the perfect leader,

670
37:32.355 --> 37:33.856
just like your parents did.

671
37:36.108 --> 37:37.943
[uneasy music playing]

672
37:48.954 --> 37:49.955
[woman] Miss!

673
37:51.665 --> 37:52.750
Miss!

674
37:53.918 --> 37:55.419
-Excuse me, miss. -What?

675
37:55.503 --> 37:57.630
[whimpers] Mr. Baek isn't in here. I'm sorry.

676
37:57.713 --> 37:59.215
Where is he?

677
37:59.298 --> 38:03.677
His schedule is confidential, even to members of his family. Apologies.

678
38:03.761 --> 38:06.597
Hey. Do I look like I'm here as a part of his family?

679
38:06.680 --> 38:09.642
I'm here as the CEO of TS Hotel. Check his schedule again!

680
38:09.725 --> 38:11.519
My name has to be there.

681
38:11.602 --> 38:13.270
[sighs] I'm so sorry.

682
38:13.354 --> 38:14.980
I don't care if you're sorry!

683
38:15.064 --> 38:18.609
Check it again now!

684
38:18.692 --> 38:21.237
-Hey, Mom! Come on. -I can't…

685
38:21.320 --> 38:24.156
How could you yell at such a beautiful young lady?

686
38:24.740 --> 38:26.492
I'm so sorry if she scared you.

687
38:26.575 --> 38:28.869
She's going through the life change right now.

688
38:28.953 --> 38:30.454
[grunts, chuckles]

689
38:30.955 --> 38:33.416
[inhales deeply] So,

690
38:34.792 --> 38:37.002
where is my one and only cousin?

691
38:38.546 --> 38:41.590
Yeah, got it. I'll call you right away.

692
38:42.967 --> 38:44.718
Yes, I'm sure. Okay.

693
38:45.845 --> 38:47.096
[call disconnect beeps]

694
38:49.181 --> 38:50.141
Mr. Baek.

695
38:51.475 --> 38:55.146
Mrs. Baek Gyeong-jin and Mr. Choi Do-yoon are at your office as we speak.

696
38:55.229 --> 38:59.525
[inhales deeply] Of all the days to pay me a visit at work…

697
38:59.608 --> 39:01.694
[sighs] That's my family for you.

698
39:03.529 --> 39:06.532
Speaking of, did you say hi to your sister?

699
39:06.615 --> 39:10.786
Yes, thank you for asking, Mr. Baek. It was good catching up.

700
39:12.830 --> 39:15.666
And I was able to track down Mr. Ji Eun-ho.

701
39:16.250 --> 39:18.752
-He's at Taesung Hospital. -Taesung Hospital?

702
39:18.836 --> 39:19.837
He's not a patient.

703
39:19.920 --> 39:22.715
He went to see someone there, after our meeting earlier.

704
39:26.760 --> 39:29.054
We'll see Dr. Jang while we're at the hospital.

705
39:29.555 --> 39:30.514
Sounds great.

706
39:34.643 --> 39:37.021
[indistinct chattering]

707
39:37.897 --> 39:39.064
[pensive music playing]

708
39:39.148 --> 39:40.983
-[gasps] -[gasps]

709
39:41.484 --> 39:43.694
Still nothing. [gasps]

710
39:46.071 --> 39:47.907
All right, up next…

711
39:47.990 --> 39:49.950
Oh! It's Ji Eun-ho! Yeah!

712
39:50.534 --> 39:53.871
-He looks just like my grandson. -[woman 1] Oh please.

713
39:53.954 --> 39:57.750
The only thing those two have in common are a mouth, two eyes and a nose.

714
39:57.833 --> 39:59.877
-[chuckling] -He really does look like him!

715
39:59.960 --> 40:02.338
-[woman 1] You say that about everyone. -[laughter]

716
40:02.421 --> 40:04.173
-It's so nice to meet you. -Nice to meet you.

717
40:04.256 --> 40:07.009
I'm so happy I'm finally able to meet you in person.

718
40:07.092 --> 40:08.969
I know I'm such a fan of yours, Jaejae,

719
40:09.053 --> 40:10.846
I've always wanted to be a guest on your show.

720
40:10.930 --> 40:12.765
-Really, I'm truly honored to be here. -Wow.

721
40:12.848 --> 40:16.936
Well, as expected from the king of romance,

722
40:17.019 --> 40:19.104
you've truly mastered sweet talking.

723
40:19.188 --> 40:21.649
So you're known for romances

724
40:21.732 --> 40:26.320
and, of course, your breakout role was in a youth drama.

725
40:26.403 --> 40:27.238
That's right.

726
40:27.321 --> 40:30.574
You made your debut in the drama Wistful Youth.

727
40:30.658 --> 40:34.411
And you still say it's your favorite work to date, right?

728
40:34.495 --> 40:35.496
[Eun-ho] Yes, exactly.

729
40:35.579 --> 40:37.248
[Jaejae] When I heard you were coming on,

730
40:37.331 --> 40:39.583
I made sure to binge-watch everything you were in.

731
40:39.667 --> 40:43.587
And wow, that one was a true masterpiece. I cried my eyes out.

732
40:43.671 --> 40:45.172
-Wow, thanks so much. -Just incredible.

733
40:45.256 --> 40:50.177
That project felt like the real beginning of my acting career.

734
40:50.261 --> 40:52.888
To my writer, hope you're watching.

735
40:53.764 --> 40:55.307
[Jaejae] Wow, that's one lucky writer.

736
40:55.891 --> 40:57.476
Oh, what's he doing?

737
40:58.727 --> 41:00.062
Bo-bae.

738
41:00.145 --> 41:01.939
-[gasps] -Ooh!

739
41:02.022 --> 41:04.942
Oh, what are you? Hey. Eun-ho! Oh…

740
41:05.818 --> 41:07.069
[woman 2] Wait a minute!

741
41:07.152 --> 41:10.406
Eun-ho, how on earth did you know I was here?

742
41:10.489 --> 41:13.909
[sighs] Is there anything about you I don't know?

743
41:14.702 --> 41:18.289
You should stop eating takeout, Bo-bae. That's probably why you're here.

744
41:18.372 --> 41:22.167
Ugh, that's not why I'm in the hospital. It's just my appendix.

745
41:22.251 --> 41:24.420
-Appendix? Did it burst? -Mm.

746
41:25.170 --> 41:27.506
Then you need surgery immediately. I'll get a doctor.

747
41:27.590 --> 41:29.008
Eun-ho, wait. [gasps painfully]

748
41:29.091 --> 41:32.011
[winces, moans]

749
41:32.094 --> 41:33.804
[Eun-ho breathing heavily]

750
41:37.016 --> 41:38.726
-Excuse me. -Mm, what? [gasps]

751
41:39.310 --> 41:41.437
Ji Eun… You're Ji Eun-ho right?

752
41:42.438 --> 41:44.982
Right. There's a patient here whose named Na Bo-bae, you know?

753
41:45.065 --> 41:47.401
-[nurse] Oh, Na Bo-bae? -Yeah.

754
41:51.322 --> 41:52.656
Mr. Ji Eun-ho?

755
41:56.410 --> 41:58.120
[intriguing music playing]

756
41:59.288 --> 42:00.581
TS RESORT SENIOR MANAGING DIRECTOR

757
42:00.664 --> 42:03.792
So the meeting with Mr. Yeom was actually for you?

758
42:03.876 --> 42:08.088
Yes. I asked him not to say anything. I didn't want to make you feel pressured.

759
42:08.172 --> 42:10.507
Well, sorry I missed our meeting.

760
42:11.216 --> 42:13.969
A friend of mine became ill. I should actually head back now.

761
42:15.471 --> 42:16.639
Don't worry.

762
42:16.722 --> 42:20.476
This hospital is part of the TS Group, so if you give me the patient's name,

763
42:21.143 --> 42:23.604
I will make sure they get the very best care.

764
42:24.188 --> 42:25.939
Have them moved to the VIP room.

765
42:26.732 --> 42:30.235
Here is the deal. In return, I'd like you to make room in your schedule for us.

766
42:30.319 --> 42:33.989
Mr. Baek, please direct all work-related questions to my agent.

767
42:37.201 --> 42:40.788
We'll accommodate all of your reasonable requests, Mr. Ji.

768
42:40.871 --> 42:43.707
[chuckles] Well, you see…

769
42:43.791 --> 42:46.001
Send the patient's coordinates, name and date of birth

770
42:46.085 --> 42:48.128
to the number on my business card.

771
42:48.962 --> 42:52.132
The TS Group is a wonderful company to work with.

772
42:52.216 --> 42:54.635
You'll see that this is just the first taste of that.

773
43:01.517 --> 43:04.228
[sighs] Wow, what a pain in my butt.

774
43:04.770 --> 43:05.771
[clicks teeth]

775
43:06.563 --> 43:09.441
-[man] Oh, where is this kid? -[sighs]

776
43:10.651 --> 43:12.986
-Huh? Hey, you brat! -You scared me!

777
43:13.070 --> 43:14.530
-Come with me. -Five more minutes.

778
43:14.613 --> 43:16.031
-What do you mean? -I can't go now.

779
43:16.115 --> 43:18.409
-Five more minutes. -Why are you here in the first place?

780
43:21.745 --> 43:25.499
Hey. Sorry, something came up.

781
43:26.500 --> 43:27.626
When's the surgery?

782
43:27.710 --> 43:31.380
Jeez. Come on. Why are you so obsessed with this girl?

783
43:31.463 --> 43:34.633
Hm, okay. I'll come visit you tomorrow, then.

784
43:35.384 --> 43:36.635
Get some rest.

785
43:37.553 --> 43:38.387
Yep.

786
43:39.012 --> 43:41.765
Going where? Your schedule is completely full.

787
43:41.849 --> 43:44.309
And why did you run out of our meeting earlier?

788
43:44.393 --> 43:46.729
Do you know how much I had to apologize?

789
43:46.812 --> 43:47.938
Hee-chan.

790
43:49.064 --> 43:52.901
Did you know the plan was for me to meet Mr. Baek Ho-rang instead of the Director?

791
43:52.985 --> 43:56.196
What? I don't know this Bacon guy. I have no idea.

792
43:56.280 --> 43:58.574
[Eun-ho inhales deeply, sighs]

793
43:58.657 --> 44:01.618
Come on. I told you I was fine with promoting my movies,

794
44:01.702 --> 44:04.913
but I'm not comfortable selling my image for ad campaigns.

795
44:04.997 --> 44:08.083
-You promised me you'd refuse those. -Well, I thought I did.

796
44:09.042 --> 44:11.837
-Guess I don't have much pull anymore. -[sighs]

797
44:12.504 --> 44:14.590
Don't let it happen again, okay?

798
44:16.425 --> 44:19.720
[Ho-rang] Let's find out who Eun-ho was visiting earlier.

799
44:19.803 --> 44:22.806
-[Yoon] Yes, sir. -[Bo-bae gasps] Excuse me.

800
44:23.307 --> 44:24.767
[jaunty music playing]

801
44:24.850 --> 44:26.602
[gasps] You again!

802
44:27.102 --> 44:28.061
[gasps]

803
44:28.145 --> 44:30.355
I've been thinking about you since we met.

804
44:30.439 --> 44:32.608
[gasps] Did you come all this way for me?

805
44:32.691 --> 44:34.026
You really need to stop.

806
44:34.109 --> 44:37.196
Oh, so I guess the spark just hit you now?

807
44:37.279 --> 44:39.114
I felt no spark at all. Absolutely nothing.

808
44:39.198 --> 44:41.533
That's just so… [gasps] …amazing!

809
44:41.617 --> 44:43.452
-Step aside. -[Bo-bae chuckles]

810
44:43.535 --> 44:45.120
-[chuckles] -[Yoon] Please move. [groans]

811
44:45.204 --> 44:47.289
Whoa! Sorry. Uh, sorry! I'm so sorry.

812
44:47.372 --> 44:48.457
[gasps painfully]

813
44:50.167 --> 44:52.961
Wait, wait, wait, wait. Just wait a second, please.

814
44:53.045 --> 44:54.171
Look. [grunts]

815
44:54.254 --> 44:57.299
This is going to sound really weird, I know.

816
44:57.382 --> 45:02.888
But you're the first person I've ever met who's like a rubber glove. [gasps]

817
45:02.971 --> 45:04.973
Can we talk, sir? [grunts]

818
45:05.057 --> 45:06.642
-No. I'm too busy. -[Bo-bae grunts]

819
45:06.725 --> 45:09.061
Uh, in that case, your number, just your number.

820
45:09.144 --> 45:10.687
Please your phone number.

821
45:10.771 --> 45:13.941
If now's not a good time, I can text you a detailed explanation instead.

822
45:14.024 --> 45:18.695
Oh, please. Can you just hear me out for one more second?

823
45:19.863 --> 45:22.241
[sighs, inhales]

824
45:23.075 --> 45:24.409
All right. [sighs]

825
45:24.993 --> 45:25.911
Um…

826
45:26.912 --> 45:27.996
Mm. What's your name?

827
45:28.080 --> 45:30.123
[relieved sigh] Na Bo-bae.

828
45:30.207 --> 45:31.291
Na Bo-bae?

829
45:31.375 --> 45:32.334
[chuckles]

830
45:32.417 --> 45:34.878
I've heard plenty of pickup lines in my day,

831
45:34.962 --> 45:36.880
but your pathetic attempt at flirting?

832
45:36.964 --> 45:39.383
-That's a first. -[disappointed musical sting plays]

833
45:39.466 --> 45:40.759
You think I'm flirting with you?

834
45:40.843 --> 45:42.970
Accidentally bumping lips with a handsome guy

835
45:43.053 --> 45:44.513
who obviously has money.

836
45:44.596 --> 45:47.057
Are you that desperate that you talk about love with a stranger?

837
45:47.140 --> 45:48.350
Even if I did touch you,

838
45:48.433 --> 45:51.103
I wouldn't feel a spark, a buzz, absolutely nothing at all.

839
45:51.186 --> 45:53.230
So stop wasting my time.

840
45:53.313 --> 45:55.482
Now, please get out!

841
45:55.566 --> 45:57.484
-[Bo-bae gasps] -[Ho-rang grunts]

842
46:00.279 --> 46:03.198
[sighs] What?

843
46:03.699 --> 46:06.326
-[Ho-rang sighs] -Well done, Mr. Baek.

844
46:07.870 --> 46:10.873
Mr. Yoon, how is it you couldn't stop a lone woman in a hospital?

845
46:10.956 --> 46:14.293
Well, I, uh… She kept giving me static shocks.

846
46:18.171 --> 46:19.381
I'm sorry, sir.

847
46:20.090 --> 46:21.675
-It's just… -What?

848
46:24.094 --> 46:24.970
Forget it.

849
46:25.053 --> 46:28.056
I'm just saying, I've never seen you be so harsh to a stranger before.

850
46:28.140 --> 46:30.601
What, you… I wasn't really that bad, was I?

851
46:32.853 --> 46:35.272
Well, you were simply being honest and direct.

852
46:35.355 --> 46:37.900
Just like you are with me. You were totally harsh, Mr. Baek.

853
46:37.983 --> 46:40.485
-[whimsical music playing] -Well, she's out of her mind!

854
46:40.569 --> 46:43.989
Talking about how I'm the first person she could ever really fall in love with.

855
46:44.072 --> 46:45.115
But she didn't say love.

856
46:45.198 --> 46:46.742
-Yes, she did. -No, she didn't.

857
46:46.825 --> 46:49.745
I'm sorry, but she said you were like a rubber glove, sir.

858
46:50.412 --> 46:53.248
-So you heard her say it too? -Yes.

859
46:54.291 --> 46:57.419
She must have misspoken. Love makes much more sense.

860
46:57.920 --> 47:00.005
Why on earth would she say rubber glove?

861
47:00.088 --> 47:02.132
Well, good point.

862
47:05.719 --> 47:06.678
[Ho-rang sighs]

863
47:07.179 --> 47:08.555
[knocking on door]

864
47:08.639 --> 47:09.806
-Yes? -[door opens]

865
47:09.890 --> 47:12.100
Oh! Hey, Ho-rang. You're here!

866
47:12.184 --> 47:13.936
-[laughs] -Yes, at last.

867
47:14.019 --> 47:16.271
-[Dr. Jang] Ah. Glad you made it. -[chuckles]

868
47:19.858 --> 47:20.859
[sighs]

869
47:27.491 --> 47:28.450
Oh! [chuckles]

870
47:28.533 --> 47:29.952
Cute, huh?

871
47:30.035 --> 47:31.370
Kissing gouramis.

872
47:31.453 --> 47:35.082
Look! Look at them! They actually kiss. [chuckles]

873
47:36.166 --> 47:37.626
[pensive music playing]

874
47:39.670 --> 47:42.923
You call that a kiss? I'm not falling for that one again.

875
47:43.423 --> 47:44.257
Ha!

876
47:44.341 --> 47:46.093
[squeaky toy squeak]

877
47:46.176 --> 47:47.511
Sorry, what? What?

878
47:48.095 --> 47:49.346
Ah, nothing. Uh…

879
47:49.429 --> 47:50.430
The battery?

880
47:50.514 --> 47:52.265
Ah! [chuckles]

881
47:52.349 --> 47:53.225
Yes.

882
47:53.308 --> 47:58.563
This is a brand-new battery model that just came out in the US.

883
47:58.647 --> 48:01.984
This technology clearly surpasses any of the old artificial hearts.

884
48:03.360 --> 48:04.695
[chuckles]

885
48:04.778 --> 48:07.155
And since we're replacing the entire device,

886
48:07.239 --> 48:09.741
we'll need to make a bigger incision in your chest,

887
48:09.825 --> 48:12.869
but this will certainly last 100 years.

888
48:13.829 --> 48:17.958
A battery that lasts a whole century. Guess it'll outlive me.

889
48:18.041 --> 48:21.461
[sighs] I'm just saying you won't have to replace it again.

890
48:21.545 --> 48:22.379
[chuckles]

891
48:23.630 --> 48:24.673
I give you my word.

892
48:25.424 --> 48:28.552
This is the last time I'll be operating on you.

893
48:29.553 --> 48:31.304
And the day after tomorrow,

894
48:31.388 --> 48:34.599
I will start working on my plan to take over the company.

895
48:35.100 --> 48:36.977
[hopeful music playing]

896
48:38.437 --> 48:41.606
So take good care of me, Doctor.

897
48:44.693 --> 48:48.488
The surgery's scheduled early tomorrow, so get some rest, Ho-rang.

898
48:49.406 --> 48:50.282
[chuckles softly]

899
48:50.866 --> 48:52.534
-[glasses clink] -[all] Cheers.

900
48:52.617 --> 48:53.910
[dance music pumping in distance]

901
48:53.994 --> 48:57.581
I heard Hanlim Advertising Agency landed TS Resort's new promo.

902
48:57.664 --> 48:59.499
[man 1] Wow, Hanlim's on a roll.

903
48:59.583 --> 49:03.628
Seems like the company's been doing great since Seol-hee was promoted to director.

904
49:04.212 --> 49:08.258
[man 2] Yeah, that's because my Seol-hee is so incredibly good at her job.

905
49:08.842 --> 49:10.010
Seol-hee,

906
49:10.093 --> 49:11.428
how do you like the wine?

907
49:12.220 --> 49:13.638
This one's a fine Romani--

908
49:13.722 --> 49:14.681
[Do-yoon] Hey, bro!

909
49:17.976 --> 49:19.102
Pour me another.

910
49:19.978 --> 49:20.979
[chuckles]

911
49:23.690 --> 49:24.983
More.

912
49:27.569 --> 49:29.362
Whoo! More.

913
49:29.446 --> 49:34.826
-Slow down. This wine should be savored… -Show me how much you love me!

914
49:37.037 --> 49:38.288
[sighs]

915
49:46.963 --> 49:48.924
[inhales sharply] I see.

916
49:49.424 --> 49:51.468
Not loving me so much after all.

917
49:52.594 --> 49:54.346
Asshole, there's not much left.

918
49:54.429 --> 49:57.432
I get it now. It's not that Si-hun's not feeling generous.

919
49:57.516 --> 50:00.727
It's just that the size of this glass is working against him.

920
50:00.811 --> 50:03.271
You can't even manage to fill it up.

921
50:05.857 --> 50:06.983
What the hell!

922
50:10.153 --> 50:12.781
[Do-yoon] Si-hun, if you plan on seducing a woman,

923
50:12.864 --> 50:16.326
maybe try to put in more effort.

924
50:16.827 --> 50:18.245
Don't be so cheap.

925
50:19.704 --> 50:22.040
Oh, Seol-hee, you're coming home with me, okay?

926
50:22.624 --> 50:24.042
No, I'm going home alone.

927
50:27.921 --> 50:28.922
Seol-hee!

928
50:32.259 --> 50:35.137
-Get in. -I don't get into cars with drunk drivers.

929
50:35.971 --> 50:37.430
Goodbye, Do-yoon.

930
50:37.514 --> 50:40.350
Mm. Fine I'll call us a driver.

931
50:43.562 --> 50:44.396
What?

932
50:45.856 --> 50:48.150
You have nothing to say? Huh?

933
50:52.362 --> 50:54.614
Even about how well I did? Hm?

934
50:55.115 --> 50:57.033
You didn't have to embarrass him like that.

935
50:57.117 --> 50:59.995
Si-hun didn't know his place and he was trying to hit on you.

936
51:00.787 --> 51:03.540
-But so are you, Do-yoon. -You're hurting my feelings here.

937
51:03.623 --> 51:06.751
You're telling me that cook and I are in the same league? Are you kidding?

938
51:06.835 --> 51:07.878
[chuckles]

939
51:08.545 --> 51:12.299
I mean, he might stir pots, but you book beds.

940
51:12.382 --> 51:13.884
What's the difference?

941
51:14.384 --> 51:17.053
At least make sure you're the heir to the TS Group

942
51:17.137 --> 51:18.638
if you're going to talk status.

943
51:19.139 --> 51:20.223
[sniffs]

944
51:20.891 --> 51:22.184
Han Seol-hee,

945
51:22.267 --> 51:24.102
you know Baek Ho-rang

946
51:24.936 --> 51:27.397
isn't interested in marrying you.

947
51:28.815 --> 51:30.317
He couldn't care less about you.

948
51:33.069 --> 51:35.572
Okay. Call yourself a driver.

949
51:35.655 --> 51:37.449
You wouldn't want another embarrassing headline

950
51:37.532 --> 51:39.242
because of a DUI, would you?

951
51:39.326 --> 51:41.203
[uneasy music playing]

952
51:47.500 --> 51:48.960
[tires screeching]

953
51:53.924 --> 51:55.759
[thunder clapping]

954
51:56.551 --> 51:58.553
[intriguing music playing]

955
52:07.938 --> 52:10.899
[Dr. Jang] Okay, if everyone's ready, we can begin.

956
52:11.566 --> 52:12.442
Scalpel.

957
52:27.123 --> 52:31.670
HEMODIALYSIS UNIT

958
52:32.254 --> 52:33.838
-[electricity crackling] -Ow, that hurt!

959
52:33.922 --> 52:36.841
Oh, I told you not to touch me with your bare hands.

960
52:36.925 --> 52:38.927
You should always wear your gloves.

961
52:39.010 --> 52:40.595
-[thunder clapping] -[gasps]

962
52:41.304 --> 52:42.681
[thunder clapping]

963
52:43.807 --> 52:44.975
[nurse 1] Okay, okay.

964
52:45.600 --> 52:46.685
Huh?

965
52:54.359 --> 52:56.194
[intriguing music continues]

966
53:15.630 --> 53:17.382
[thunder clapping]

967
53:20.176 --> 53:23.930
-[doctor 1] Did the power go out? -[doctor 2] What about emergency power?

968
53:24.014 --> 53:26.683
There's a problem. The emergency power isn't coming on.

969
53:26.766 --> 53:28.852
It'll take three minutes for the generator to start.

970
53:28.935 --> 53:30.603
-Turn the crank manually! -[doctor 3] Okay!

971
53:31.855 --> 53:34.232
-[tense music playing] -[mechanical whirring]

972
53:41.531 --> 53:42.741
Okay, slowly.

973
53:44.617 --> 53:48.330
Um, excuse me. Hold on. Can you really perform surgery in the dark?

974
53:49.039 --> 53:52.959
Wait. Don't hospitals have some kind of backup power during a blackout?

975
53:53.043 --> 53:57.213
I'm a little scared. I'm not gonna die during an appendectomy, right?

976
53:57.297 --> 53:59.966
Don't worry, Miss Na. The generator will kick in soon.

977
54:00.675 --> 54:01.676
[Bo-bae whimpers]

978
54:01.760 --> 54:03.428
[music building]

979
54:04.637 --> 54:06.806
[dramatic music stabs]

980
54:06.890 --> 54:08.391
[tense music continues]

981
54:10.435 --> 54:12.687
OPERATING ROOM

982
54:23.323 --> 54:26.951
Oh, I think I'm the one who's making the lights go on.

983
54:30.288 --> 54:31.331
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

984
54:31.414 --> 54:34.000
Oh, the power is coming back because of me.

985
54:42.008 --> 54:43.718
[machine beeping]

986
54:46.012 --> 54:49.766
-[doctor 2] He's in cardiac arrest. -[doctor 1] Another milliliter of epi!

987
54:50.266 --> 54:52.519
[machine flatlining]

988
54:59.067 --> 55:01.861
[rhythmic beeping]

989
55:03.530 --> 55:05.240
-[music fades] -[doctor 1] Vitals are normal.

990
55:05.740 --> 55:09.619
-Blood pressure is good. 120 over 80. -Okay. Reduce flow.

991
55:10.453 --> 55:11.704
Let's close him up.

992
55:25.218 --> 55:27.637
[groans tiredly]

993
55:28.596 --> 55:30.223
[uneasy music playing]

994
55:41.943 --> 55:43.403
[music fades]

995
55:49.951 --> 55:51.744
[intriguing music playing]

996
55:57.417 --> 55:58.585
[gasps]

997
56:06.509 --> 56:07.510
What?

998
56:09.429 --> 56:11.806
What is he doing in my room? [gasps]

999
56:15.768 --> 56:16.936
[softly] Hello?

1000
56:21.608 --> 56:22.942
[grunts]

1001
56:24.152 --> 56:25.445
Hello?

1002
56:27.572 --> 56:28.907
[music fades]

1003
56:30.742 --> 56:32.452
[intriguing music resumes]

1004
56:34.787 --> 56:35.955
Ow!

1005
56:47.008 --> 56:48.051
Hello?

1006
56:52.096 --> 56:53.306
[music fades]

1007
57:18.373 --> 57:20.166
Oh, this is weird.

1008
57:21.251 --> 57:23.795
My electric charge has no effect on him? [gasps]

1009
57:27.298 --> 57:30.051
If this guy really is my rubber glove,

1010
57:30.885 --> 57:33.346
that means that I can actually touch him

1011
57:33.846 --> 57:36.724
and maybe even… date him?

1012
57:41.771 --> 57:44.357
[tinkling romantic music playing]

1013
57:59.455 --> 58:01.165
[music intensifies]

1014
58:07.005 --> 58:08.715
[romantic Korean ballad playing]

1015
59:43.810 --> 59:45.687
[music fades out]
